01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OF9GY1TDSpoQ7kNvwF_Pqr4&_nc_oc=AdqoS62_lQaVcprNqTwOS0KmLRCSuFXU4tMzN_IOEdYvvPEG_jxq3J0YqeWLSJZgb4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHUVCjhDPI6eaCim50KuwPMt7oJECq9FHaLdXyNanxqRg&oe=6A7EFF3D"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gIP4qwtlFdwQ7kNvwEvbUll&_nc_oc=AdpUmt5UyLFRNtcGYWk082-bIEw-zTvqa9Z264j0qYFK8jJ6QFWWYRgOHJDErFy6sbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHs_TKVhbCLXQP3ZV2ca5U3ZBg5olyZEOmnE8WhR0G5KA&oe=6A7F1DBB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jzBDdscZQSsQ7kNvwFt6tDv&_nc_oc=Adq-DUWhIlPDALcyBWpNvf5XeAyZxsIfcN8nNLe1qxMld2xXiXCo3dKrDny9NVW3jjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE9NgecPXWflfBtfs4ErzSktzXSK7vU2DsJYUcILqQ7Fw&oe=6A7EFAA5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a